Source: sentin8
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Sentin8 Platform Engineering <platform@local.sentin8.dev>
Build-Depends: debhelper (>= 13), cargo, rustc, libssl-dev, pkg-config
Standards-Version: 4.6.0
Homepage: https://github.com/Sentin8/sentin8
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/Sentin8/sentin8.git

Package: sentin8-common
Architecture: all
Description: Sentin8 platform shared data
 Sentin8 platform shared data — platform SQL, vertical-registry.json,
 catalog.json, and Flutter web assets (dash, auth-ui).

Package: sentin8
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: sentin8-common, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: postgresql-18, valkey-server
Description: Sentin8 platform runtime
 Sentin8 platform runtime — all backend service binaries (auth, bff, db,
 storage, bus, sys, app, acme, captain, proxy, web, post, stat, func,
 func, cron, flow), systemd unit, and logrotate config.
 .
 PostgreSQL 18 and Valkey are external URL-addressed dependencies
 (DATABASE_URL / VALKEY_URL). They may be local (system packages) or remote
 (managed cloud). This package Recommends (not Depends) the system packages
 so remote hosting works.

Package: sentin8-dev
Architecture: all
Description: Sentin8 build kit
 Sentin8 build kit — sentin8-cli, vendored crate local-registry,
 sentin8-build-info crate, Rust SDKs, and cargo config template.
 .
 Enables verticals (bank8, hotel8, etc.) to build their binaries against
 the sentin8 crate registry without the sentin8 source repo.

Package: sentin8-postgres-config
Architecture: all
Depends: postgresql-18
Description: PostgreSQL certificate-identity configuration for Sentin8
 PostgreSQL certificate identity — the TLS-only pg_hba.conf and
 the pgm identity map for Sentin8's per-service certificate-
 authenticated database roles. Applies to any local or remote
 PostgreSQL 18 host.